/td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">5</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">14</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">3</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">9</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">4</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Duration of OA / years (Mean &#x000b1; SD)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">6.3 &#x000b1; 5.8</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Dominance (n)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Right</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">30</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Left</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Affected side (n)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Right</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">14</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Left</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">16</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Pain (n)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Yes</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">28</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">No</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Crepitation (n)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Yes</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">29</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">No</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1</td></tr></tbody></table></table-wrap><table-wrap id="t2-cln63_2p0197" position="float"><label>Table 2</label><caption><p>RHR, WHR, WV and PCI measurements (mean &#x000b1; SD) for patients with knee osteoarthritis while walking with and without canes</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><tbody><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">resting heart rate (beats/minute)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">WWC</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">77.1 (10.1)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">WC1</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">77.3 (10)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">WC2</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">78.1 (9.9)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">WC3</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">77 (9.4)</td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" align="left" rowspan="1"><hr/></td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">walking heart rate (beats/minute)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">WWC</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">85.2 (9.8) * &#x025a1; &#x000d7;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">WC1</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">88.1 (9.9)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">WC2</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">87.7 (9.6)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">WC3</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">87.8 (9.8)</td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" align="left" rowspan="1"><hr/></td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">walking velocity (meters/minute)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">WWC</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">46 (9.6) * &#x025a1; &#x000d7;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">WC1</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">38.4 (7.4)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">WC2</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">38.6 (6.8)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">WC3</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">38.6 (6.4)</td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" align="left" rowspan="1"><hr/></td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">physiological cost index (beats/meters)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">WWC</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.17 (0.07) * &#x025a1; &#x000d7;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">WC1</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.28 (0.10) &#x000b0; &#x02022;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">WC2</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.25 (0.10) &#x0221d;&#x000d7; &#x025bf;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">WC3</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.28 (0.10) &#x000b0; &#x003c6;</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn1-cln63_2p0197"><p>WWC = walking without cane; WC1 = walking with a cane length to the greater trochanter; WC2 = walking with a cane length to the distal wrist crease; WC3 = walking with a cane length obtained by the formula: Length = Height x 0.45 + 0.87 m;</p></fn><fn id="tfn2-cln63_2p0197"><label>*</label><p><italic>p</italic> &#x0003c; 0.01 compared to WC1;</p></fn><fn id="tfn3-cln63_2p0197"><label>&#x025a1;</label><p><italic>p</italic> &#x0003c; 0.001 compared to WC2;</p></fn><fn id="tfn4-cln63_2p0197"><label>&#x000d7;</label><p><italic>p</italic> &#x0003c; 0.01 compared to WC3;</p></fn><fn id="tfn5-cln63_2p0197"><label>&#x000b0;</label><p><italic>p</italic> &#x0003c; 0.01 compared to WWC;</p></fn><fn id="tfn6-cln63_2p0197"><label